OL,3,GNEWSAGolden wedding celebration for
OL,4,Ahospital volunteers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo hospital volunteers who spend their
OL,7,Ftime supporting patients at Bradford
OL,8,FRoyal Infirmary have celebrated their
OL,9,Fgolden wedding anniversary.
OL,11,FLillian and Wayne Deakin, from
OL,12,FKeighley, marked 50 years of marriage
OL,13,Fon 18 September.
OL,15,FThe couple both volunteer with the
OL,16,FSpiritual, Pastoral and Religious Care
OL,17,F(SPaRC) team at Bradford Royal
OL,18,FInfirmary (BRI), where staff helped
OL,19,Fthem celebrate passing the milestone.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
