OL,3,GNEWSAGolden wedding celebration for
OL,4,Ahospital volunteers
OL,5,
OL,6,FEx-council worker Wayne, 76, who began
OL,7,Fvolunteering in 2019, supports patients
OL,8,Fon Ward 4 and Ward 31 while Lillian,
OL,9,F71, a former nurse, who started
OL,10,Fvolunteering after retiring from work
OL,11,Fon the main reception desk at St Luke's
OL,12,FHospital, covers Wards 1 and 22.
